{"path":"/zh/concepts/structural-writeback-gate/","title":"结构写回门禁：在副作用前检查工程不变量","blocks":[{"block_id":"adps-3072834476797c5d-1","revision":"3072834476797c5dfbfd2df4d64b152b78d8cb5588d32baebda21c34be3b1416","tag":"p","quote":"建模 Agent 可以画出一张像样的图，模型库里仍然存在悬空关系、错误归属、重复对象或空变更。等到写回后再让模型点评，工程状态已经被污染。"},{"block_id":"adps-8671a8a390d4ab10-1","revision":"8671a8a390d4ab10c1b56569b9711cdfb9b61c1f0b6621980d94a1a0941562c2","tag":"p","quote":"结构写回门禁位于候选计划与正式工程模型库之间。它在产生副作用前检查："},{"block_id":"adps-abcadb0a938e50bb-1","revision":"abcadb0a938e50bbef5268fc6e752b3e73282aa19fcce898e2957ef6a02613e0","tag":"li","quote":"范围存在、唯一且允许写入；"},{"block_id":"adps-a1849a0da9f9bcc3-1","revision":"a1849a0da9f9bcc390c818f4ff4c667e208f202b188ffcddeb624b83bb1a52c0","tag":"li","quote":"元素、关系和图类型合法；"},{"block_id":"adps-095dccfcf2a013e4-1","revision":"095dccfcf2a013e42dfdb0a553f7c59a5b49d4ed3a3d9f17596e3303bc4412c6","tag":"li","quote":"每条关系的端点形成引用闭包；"},{"block_id":"adps-82bceec3dbcbc317-1","revision":"82bceec3dbcbc3179e2ebb6933295678656a9e0e8a69fb65a639c44e6caf2739","tag":"li","quote":"用户明确列举的对象完整进入计划；"},{"block_id":"adps-0975e90fb24873e3-1","revision":"0975e90fb24873e33d8a7ed6924abdc3e03ddd9153d1e29c86a0be8ce465204d","tag":"li","quote":"视图内容是已验收模型结果的子集；"},{"block_id":"adps-1b5fb274b00b758a-1","revision":"1b5fb274b00b758a61e9afe8717e668456d0add133ad03946a0046ec9a17b0d5","tag":"li","quote":"写入产生真实增量，空增量记录为 NOOP；"},{"block_id":"adps-4d5b9ab63445544a-1","revision":"4d5b9ab63445544ab7c1e1194509d056e57596818198b8234a6bf33664a73fff","tag":"li","quote":"模型库和画布经过唯一写回通道，并生成回执与撤销句柄。"},{"block_id":"adps-18993cb7600376b8-1","revision":"18993cb7600376b81438cada3e617d62d6e9c24338196df50ebc452a5b8db93b","tag":"p","quote":"结果使用有限枚举：APPLIED、APPLIED_WITH_WARNINGS、BLOCKED、NOOP。"},{"block_id":"adps-b107b72fc6ce0cbd-1","revision":"b107b72fc6ce0cbdad4673a9c3139175d20adc4544d76e5df59a765f0005a921","tag":"p","quote":"门禁检查可程序化的不变量，不承担全部建模品质评审。命名、粒度和方案合理性可在写前人审、生成评审或离线评估中处理。"},{"block_id":"adps-b975be26ca5e63db-1","revision":"b975be26ca5e63dbc3bad9081e495d47007428cb89fea908d5d88b9b03aba540","tag":"li","quote":"初始研究来源：AI4MBSE 建模 Agent 项目，作者袁良锭（Liangding Yuan）；ADPS 依据公开机制归纳。"},{"block_id":"adps-2324b41eaddc1326-1","revision":"2324b41eaddc1326d8aa752e2a77a1ef7ba04b6390fd28eed3e322fbe94e5a4c","tag":"li","quote":"历史近邻：admission controller、database constraint、precondition、transaction validation。"},{"block_id":"adps-2ec5bcc5d752ea0f-1","revision":"2ec5bcc5d752ea0ff37c4a9ca69c10b2b0340c3374e9a09d077f9ed5b625e4a9","tag":"li","quote":"ADPS 整理：把验证对象换成 Agent 候选结构，并把裁决连到写回回执和结果状态。"},{"block_id":"adps-743b4de8c8fad102-1","revision":"743b4de8c8fad1025fec60b82cbc3451ba186867670e02df78b604cf3bd9eb89","tag":"li","quote":"定义地位：ADPS 重述。"},{"block_id":"adps-57bdf3334b75f2ef-1","revision":"57bdf3334b75f2ef23888a7d5d0622304cccd438037a66a30998c1d3f2297788","tag":"p","quote":"初始来源：AI4MBSE 建模 Agent 项目；作者：袁良锭（Liangding Yuan）。"},{"block_id":"adps-07336cb1f093d306-1","revision":"07336cb1f093d306f9f6694518f0138fa9925bd53440f26b6e21d427504c348d","tag":"p","quote":"案例报告目录 · 模式目录 · CC BY 4.0"},{"block_id":"adps-3c551855df185a69-1","revision":"3c551855df185a69bba5e6c436054cab73b1e5df7050f512e066b3f937c0e637","tag":"p","quote":"在 ADPS Chronicle 中查看"}]}
